1) Create a realistic study schedule.

2) Take regular breaks - 5 minutes every hour.

3) Practice deep breathing exercises.

4) Get adequate sleep - 7-8 hours is essential.

5) Stay hydrated and eat healthy.

6) Exercise - even a 10-minute walk helps.

7) Avoid comparing with others.

